WEBVTT

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:10.196
This video shows how to promote students to the next year on your phone. You will choose the two years, choose a class, review each student, and promote them.

00:00:11.874 --> 00:00:17.298
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Management, and then tap Promotion.

00:00:21.266 --> 00:00:31.370
Tap the first list and choose the year you are promoting from. Tap the second list and choose the year you are promoting to. Then tap Next.

00:00:31.838 --> 00:00:38.270
Tap the class list, choose the class you want to promote, here Class 1 - A, and tap Next.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:54.624
Every student has a card with an Action and a Target Class. This is the highest class, so the action starts as Graduate. Change each student's action to Promote, then choose Class 2 - A as the target class for everyone.

00:01:08.262 --> 00:01:16.590
Scroll down and tap Promote Students. The screen says Promotion Complete, and shows how many students were promoted.

00:01:27.082 --> 00:01:32.530
The students are promoted. Repeat these steps for the other classes.
